# Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL) for SmartDoorLight IoT System
# Enforces least-privilege topic access for backend and edge devices.

# Backend Spring Boot Service:
# Allowed full read and write access to all device topics and broker status ($SYS)
user smartdoor_backend
topic readwrite smartdoor/device/#
topic read $SYS/#

# ESP32 Edge Device:
# Allowed write access to telemetry, events, and status (LWT)
# Allowed read (subscribe) access only to incoming commands and configuration
user smartdoor_esp32
topic write smartdoor/device/+/telemetry
topic write smartdoor/device/+/event
topic write smartdoor/device/+/status
topic read smartdoor/device/+/command
topic read smartdoor/device/+/config
